// REJECTS: Field 'modelIncludes' is required
//
// A Binding requires contentType AND modelIncludes. `schemaSet`/`schemaId` are the OPTIONAL
// pair -- the positive fixture's SchemalessBinding proves a Binding with no schema set at
// all is legal -- so the natural guess about which fields are mandatory is backwards.
//
// A rewrite that makes the schema reference required and the model list optional gets both
// halves wrong and still parses every real-world Binding.
###ExternalFormat
Binding fixture::neg::BindingWithoutModelIncludes
{
   contentType: 'application/json';
}
